{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u30fbA physics-based tower defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies have no health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend against waves of enemies by mastering physics to push them off the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/32b12bc7e6675531318d053e0d718f10.poster.avif?t=1772966196\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/32b12bc7e6675531318d053e0d718f10.webm?t=1772966196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/32b12bc7e6675531318d053e0d718f10.mp4?t=1772966196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u30fbBuild the perfect deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique. Discover new game-changing tower cards and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/93ac73632424b5fc35b0c22332c5b5d2.poster.avif?t=1772966196\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/93ac73632424b5fc35b0c22332c5b5d2.webm?t=1772966196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/93ac73632424b5fc35b0c22332c5b5d2.mp4?t=1772966196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u30fbDiscover creative synergies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towers work together through physical forces rather than scripted effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrink enemies to make them easier to push, or risk growing them to gain <strong>increased rewards.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/1705cffc32f2e5068c02c2fc563fe74d.poster.avif?t=1772966196\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/1705cffc32f2e5068c02c2fc563fe74d.webm?t=1772966196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/1705cffc32f2e5068c02c2fc563fe74d.mp4?t=1772966196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u30fbHow far can you get?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your best defenses to the test in endless mode against increasingly difficult waves of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on the leaderboards to see how your build compares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/7b016b73d8b11c6d1d7ac4140e5f2603.poster.avif?t=1772966196\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/7b016b73d8b11c6d1d7ac4140e5f2603.webm?t=1772966196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084810/extras/7b016b73d8b11c6d1d7ac4140e5f2603.mp4?t=1772966196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3084810?t=1772966196","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps